# Glamorous Outlaw: "{2}, Exile this card from your hand: Target land gains "{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}" until this card is cast
# from exile. You may cast this card for as long as it remains exiled." Bot1 exiles it for {2} to give its Island the
# ability, which adds one of those three colors and never green, and casts it from exile on the same turn, the Island
# adding the {R} of its cost (the ruling: the ability may be used to cast it). It enters: 2 damage to each opponent, and
# Bot1 scries 2, keeping one card and putting the other on the bottom. Once it was cast, the Island has only {U} again.

